{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14805","headline":"奉和户曹叔夏夜寓直寄呈同曹诸公幷见示 · 卢纶","name":"奉和户曹叔夏夜寓直寄呈同曹诸公幷见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歛板捧清词，恭闻侍直时。\n暮尘归衆骑，邃宇舍诸司。\n华月先灯至，清风与簟随。\n乱萤光熠熠，行树影离离。\n龙卧人宁识，鹏抟鷃岂知。\n便因当五夜，敢望竹林期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}